    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a bonus action, you can attempt to curse a creature you can see within 30 feet. The creature cannot regain hit points until the end of its next turn. Additionally, any temporary hit points it possesses are removed. When the effect ends, it regains any temporary hit points it possessed.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> The curse lasts for 1 minute. At the end of each of its turns, the cursed creature can make a Wisdom saving throw. On a success, this curse ends.</p>",
